<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITEQ raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITEQ raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded ITEQ Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ITEQ gained 3/4 to 10-1/8.</p>
</text>
